  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: S6
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Replaying these scenes over and over\u2026"
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Most don\u2019t even bother."
  - speaker: 0
    text: At least not the painful ones.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "You regret your life, don\u2019t you?"
  - speaker: 0
    text: How you lived it.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Your decisions.
  - speaker: 2
    text: "Even if you did have a second chance\u2026"
  - speaker: 2
    text: Would you waste it like the first?
